                                                "sense_id": "987d0941-8c31-3a3c-95ac-21203ad06754",
                                                "text": "Thus fable reports that the fair Grimalkin, whom Venus, at the desire of a passionate lover, converted from a cat into a fine woman, no sooner perceived a mouse than, mindful of her former sport, and still retaining her pristine nature, she leaped from the bed of her husband to pursue the little animal."
                                            }
